{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23763","headline":"病假中庞少尹携鱼酒相过 · 白居易","name":"病假中庞少尹携鱼酒相过","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宦情牢落年将暮，病假联緜日渐深。\n被老相催虽白首，与春无分未甘心。\n闲停茶椀从容语，醉把花枝取次吟。\n劳动故人庞阁老，提鱼携酒远相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}